<title>USA: Laurel, Miss., won by First Tennessee Bank.</title>
<headline>Laurel, Miss., won by First Tennessee Bank.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Tennessee Bank said it won $4 million of Laurel, Miss., general obligation bonds, Series 1996, with a net interest cost of 5.496 percent.</p>
</text>
